{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"李家超出發訪問北京和上海\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/CE-BJ-261103-12.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】行政長官李家超出發訪問北京和上海。</p><p>行政長官李家超早上抵達機場，他會先到北京出席周三上午舉行的京港洽談會開幕式，並與北京市官員會面；同日轉往上海，周四出席進博會開幕式，並在虹橋國際經濟論壇致辭，周五返港。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:50.223563+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T21:18:27.572717+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:19:02.221064+00:00","content_hash":"2cac763adfe9d90659ce6043cda58f854ebfaba59cb4a6b6783c06d116e88ecf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:50.223563+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}